<section class="section section--soft" id="njord">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="njord-block" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">One week of it &middot; August 2026</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">We took it to Njord</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Njord, the Autonomous Ship Challenge, is the international student competition for autonomous
        surface vessels, held on the Trondheimsfjord by students at NTNU. It was the first time we entered
        the boat in anything, and it was a rough week: the hull flooded during testing on day one, and we
        spent the rest of it rebuilding between runs. We finished fourteenth, and came home with a much
        better list of what to fix than a clean run would have given us.
      </p>
      <div class="njord-cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/competition">Read what happened at Njord 2026</a>
        <p class="njord-link">
          More about the competition at
          <a href="https://www.njordchallenge.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">njordchallenge.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

